  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-10T04:55:07.789Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Oftentimes when searching for a world, you're given over a dozen instances which are either full to capacity or above that. It would be nice to be able to have a few of these settings, amongst others\n- Hide full instances\n- Sort from lowest player count to highest (which is currently locked to the opposite)\n- Sort by numerical order\n- Sort by world name\n- Sort by current user count amongst all instances\n\nAnd the likes",
